  "kind": "binary",
  "prediction_point": "End date of the base term (base-term grades posted), before the comparison term's census.",
  "target_definition": "Uses registrar/retention_cohort_members exactly. target_institutional = enrolled in ANY programme at the census of the same season one year later; for SUMMER_TO_SUMMER, students who skipped the optional Summer but were enrolled at the next Fall census also count as retained (continuation). target_programme = the same, but only in the base-term programme. One model family per comparison type (FALL_TO_FALL, SPRING_TO_SPRING, SUMMER_TO_SUMMER).",
  "population": "FINAL comparisons only (comparison census on/before 2026-11-10); graduates before the comparison excluded (completions); rows whose admission outcome was already recorded at the base-term end excluded (730 rows).",
